rted set (§5.6)]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>LINK_TIMEOUT</Text><Enum>2010</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ ── Framework 2010–2019: external device / link supervision (Core §3.15) ──]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>DEVICE_NOT_READY</Text><Enum>2011</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>DEVICE_PROTOCOL_ERROR</Text><Enum>2012</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>CARRIER_READ_FAILED</Text><Enum>2020</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ ── Framework 2020–2029: traceability / part context (Core §3.16) ──]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>CARRIER_WRITE_FAILED</Text><Enum>2021</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>PART_ID_MISMATCH</Text><Enum>2022</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>RESULT_RECORD_REJECTED</Text><Enum>2023</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>EVENT_PART_RECEIVED</Text><Enum>2024</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.16.3 canonical part-lifecycle events (MESSAGE ring entries, not faults)]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>EVENT_PART_PROCESSING_STARTED</Text><Enum>2025</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>EVENT_PART_PROCESSED</Text><Enum>2026</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>EVENT_PART_PROCESSING_ABORTED</Text><Enum>2027</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>NOK_LIMIT_REACHED</Text><Enum>2028</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.16.5 the Unit's NOK-part limit tripped (MANUAL_RESET; Start refused)]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>COMMISSIONING_GATE_ACTIVE</Text><Enum>2030</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ ── Framework 2030–2039: engineering / commissioning build gates (Core §7.5) ──
 One LOW/SYSTEM event per ACTIVE gate: not clearable, not shelvable, and
 AUTO_RESET so it never blocks the commissioning it exists to serve.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>CONFIG_RESTORE_LOST</Text><Enum>2040</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ ── Framework 2040–2049: configuration persistence & parameter sets (§3.8b) ──
 A retained image was REJECTED (an unrecognized schema version), so the
 owning module is running on its declared defaults. Version 0 — never
 written — is a first boot that lost nothing and raises nothing.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>CONFIG_PERSIST_FAILED</Text><Enum>2041</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ An accepted write did not reach non-volatile storage inside the declared
 window. Transport ack and Accepted mean LIVE, never DURABLE.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>CONFIG_SET_REJECTED</Text><Enum>2042</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ A parameter-set load was refused. Staged and all-or-nothing: nothing in
