/ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_PermitsLevelLogged</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Gated-entry form of M_PermitsLevel: a refusal is audited like a refused
 gated action (§7.7(c)), so a value refused by its class leaves the same trace.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Required</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_AccessLevel</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>RecordActivity</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Called only by accepted gated operator actions. Keeping this explicit prevents
