tem><SubItem><Name>StaleAfterMs</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: declared window for staying current (§3.8e(d))]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataParCmd</Name><BitSize>8</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Reserved</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ line data takes no command: physical four-structure contract]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataOutCmd</Name><BitSize>8</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Reserved</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ no command result]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineStatus</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §3.8e(d) - what a copy of line data says about itself.]]></Comment><BitSize>1184</BitSize><SubItem><Name>LineId</Name><Type>STRING(40)</Type><BitSize>328</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Role</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_LineRole</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>352</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Owner</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ identity of the copy this one came from]]></Comment><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>384</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Revision</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ revision held here]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1056</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>LastUpdate</Name><Type>DATE_AND_TIME</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: last successful update (§2.7 clock)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1088</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TimeSynchronized</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ quality of LastUpdate]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1120</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Stale</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: no successful update within the declared window]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1128</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>SourceError</Name><Type>DINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 ok; 1 wrong line; 2 not applicable whole; else source error]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1152</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ShiftCalendar</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §8.5.2(a) - a line's shift calendar. Line data (§3.8e): edited once at the
 owner, mirrored whole. Compact on purpose - five registered values - so a line
 module keeps room for the project's own line data. A shift is named by its index
