 part of the Unit forest: it is no Unit, EM or CM, has no parent, and is never
 registered as anyone's child. The composition root declares it beside the roots
 (as it does a control domain, §9.8) and every root on the line references it
 with SetLine. A project registers its line values here (the ordinary
 M_RegisterConfig* calls, Kind := LINE_CFG, keys 'line.*'); each referencing
 root publishes them as its own line data and routes their writes here, so they
 are edited, audited and access-classed exactly like any other value, through
 the one mailbox. It extends FB_ModuleBase only because the typed value registry
 lives there (ModuleType NONE); commands are refused.

 The OWNER is the only editable copy; every accepted change raises Revision and
 the whole line is republished as Image. A MIRROR, on another controller or a
 root that is not the owner's, obtains the owner's Image through I_LineSource and
 applies a new revision whole or not at all; its values are read-only to every
 client. A mirror that stops updating keeps running on the revision it has and
 says so (Stale): a shift boundary one revision old is a reporting error, not a
 hazard, so staleness never blocks production on its own (§3.8e(d)).]]></Comment><BitSize>399232</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_ModuleBase</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>ParCfg</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataParCfg</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>265408</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ParCmd</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataParCmd</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>265472</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>OutCmd</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataOutCmd</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>265480</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>OutImm</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineStatus</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.8e(d) - what this copy says about itself]]></Comment><BitSize>1184</BitSize><BitOffs>265504</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Image</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineImage</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ what a mirror reads, by symbol, over its source]]></Comment><BitSize>65568</BitSize><BitOffs>266688</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_revision</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ owner: current; mirror: last applied]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>332256</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>TcPersistent</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Calendar</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ShiftCalendar</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ §8.5.2 - line data like any other: edited at the owner]]></Comment><BitSize>160</BitSize><BitOffs>332288</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>TcPersistent</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubIte