 a line the projection refused to render, a document over
 MAX_PERSIST_DOC_BYTES, or a medium that refused the request.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Medium</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_PersistMedium</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Key</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Store</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_ConfigStore</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>SetName</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter><Local><Name>info</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ConfigSetInfo</Type><BitSize>2016</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>record</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ConfigRecord</Type><BitSize>2720</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>line</Name><Type>STRING(480)</Type><BitSize>3848</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>i</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>M_Read</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Start reading the document under Key; M_Parse takes it once M_Poll is done.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Medium</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_PersistMedium</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Key</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>_M_Start</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Medium</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_PersistMedium</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Key</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Write</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>M_Parse</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Parse the document last read into Store as one set, and return its header.
 FALSE = not a whole, well-formed set: a line too long, a header or record that
 does not parse, a record count that disagrees, or a store that refused it.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Store</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_ConfigStore</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Info</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core" ReferenceTo="true">ST_ConfigSetInfo</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>InOut</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Local><Name>header</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ConfigSetInfo</Type><BitSize>2016</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>record</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ConfigRecord</Type><BitSize>2720</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>line</Name><Type>STRING(480)</Type><BitSize>3848</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>pLine</Name><Type PointerTo="1">BYTE</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>pos</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>n</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>lines</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>records</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>opened</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>_M_AppendLine</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Append one rendered line and its LF. An empty line is a line the projection
