 drives its coils the same way. Owner-private: no module identity, no published
 state, no I/O - the owner writes the level it returns, and keeps every decision
 that is not timing (which coil, interlocks, HELD, abort, end-of-move reset).

 A move that pulses switches its coil on for PulsingWidth at the start of every
 PulsingPeriod until the owner reports its target confirmed; any other move holds
 the coil on. MinTimeElapsed reports that the move has been commanded for at
 least MinOutputTime, for valves that cannot switch faster than that.]]></Comment><BitSize>640</BitSize><SubItem><Name>MinTimeElapsed</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_pulsing</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ this move pulses until its target is confirmed]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>72</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_tMin</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_Standard">TON</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ since the move began]]></Comment><BitSize>256</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_tPeriod</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_Standard">TON</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ the running pulse period]]></Comment><BitSize>256</BitSize><BitOffs>384</BitOffs></SubItem><Method><Name>M_Begin</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Start a move: the scan the owner first energizes the coil.]]></Comment><Parameter><Name>Pulsing</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>MinOutputTime</Name><Type>TIME</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>__getPulsing</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Whether this move was begun as a pulsing move.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Local><Name>Pulsing</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>M_Coil</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ The coil level for this scan of the move begun by M_Begin. Steady holds the coil
