ore §2.2 base) with
 OPTIONAL and REDUNDANT position sensors (safety cylinders). Per position: 0..N
 sensors; 0 = sensorless (time-based). 'Arrived' = ALL present sensors TRUE (AND,
 safest); a persistent split of redundant sensors faults (discrepancy monitoring).
 The type is ONLY its device logic; lifecycle/timing/first-out/abort are inherited.]]></Comment><BitSize>310720</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_ControlModuleBase</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>Command</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">E_ConfigurableCylinderCommand</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>265472</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ParCfg</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">ST_ConfigurableCylinderParCfg</Type><BitSize>416</BitSize><BitOffs>265504</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ParCmd</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">ST_ConfigurableCylinderParCmd</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>265920</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>OutCmd</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">ST_ConfigurableCylinderOutCmd</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>265952</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>OutImm</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">ST_ConfigurableCylinderOutImm</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>265984</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Intlk</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_PermIntlk</Type><BitSize>40320</BitSize><BitOffs>266048</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_hal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_ConfigurableCylinderHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>306368</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>OPC.UA.DA</Name><Value>0</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_recipe</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_RecipeProvider</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>306432</Bi