 cylinder never drives its home output: the spring is the home stroke.]]></Comment><Parameter><Name>ToWork</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Level</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>PrepareRecipe</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Model</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ModelId</Type><BitSize>7856</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>Setup</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Name</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>HalRef</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_ConfigurableCylinderHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Recipe</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_RecipeProvider</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Local><Name>InitialModel</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ModelId</Type><BitSize>7856</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>SetAreaSafe</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §7.2/§7.2.1 — the application supplies this type's area/process interlock,
 the same shape as SetDirectionalPermits: a method (not an OPC UA write), and the
 condition is re-evaluated every scan so a manual command obeys the same rule.

 This replaces a SIM-only force hook that used to drive Cond[1] directly. That
 hook was the ONLY writer of the condition, so the slot an operator sees as
 "area safe" could be moved by a test and by nothing else: a reusable type
 published an interlock its application had no way to supply (§7.2.1), and the
 bypass shipped in every release build (§5.7). Driving the real condition is
 also strictly better test evidence - T3 now exercises the shipped path.

 Defaults TRUE: a station that declares no area interlock is not gated by one.]]></Comment><Parameter><Name>Ok</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>DescriptionKey</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>AbortRecipe</Name></Method><Method><Name>_M_PosSplit</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ TRUE iff the position's redundant sensors DISAGREE (at least one TRUE and at
