tList</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>InOut</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>_M_Offset</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Pose + offset, in the nest's own frame. This is a corridor step, not a
