 the caller should fault with - the planner never raises events itself, so it
 stays usable from a test with no module around it.]]></Comment><ReturnType>DINT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Gripper</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>FromNest</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 = start is a help position]]></Comment><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>FromHelp</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 = start is a nest]]></Comment><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ToNest</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 = target is a help position]]></Comment><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ToHelp</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 = target is a nest]]></Comment><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Route</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_RobotPointList</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>InOut</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Local><Name>_departHelp</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>_approachHelp</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>_direct</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>_i</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>_M_AffinityIndex</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Index of the affinity entry naming this help on this nest; 0 if absent.]]></Comment><ReturnType>INT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>16</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Gripper</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Nest</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>HelpId</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Parameter><Local><Name>_i</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>_M_AddPose</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Append a move-to-pose point, refusing rather than growing past the bound.]]></Comment><Parameter><Name>P</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">ST_RobotPose