al><Name>iSimulation</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">I_SimulatedRobotConnector</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>An_aborted_path_reports_its_progress_for_a_deliberate_continue</Name></Method><Method><Name>Home_is_exempt_from_the_reference_check</Name></Method><Method><Name>Capabilities_are_published_and_a_command_not_offered_is_refused_before_issuing</Name></Method><Method><Name>Arm_power_and_the_applied_speed_are_published</Name></Method><Method><Name>Motion_before_homing_is_refused</Name></Method><Method><Name>A_routine_that_leaves_its_demand_standing_faults</Name></Method><Method><Name>Set_payload_reaches_the_controller</Name></Method><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>FB_AxisJog_Tests</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §9 / §7.6.1 — jogging an axis by hand under a safety-rated enabling
 device, and the derivation that decides whether one is permitting.

 The derivation tests matter more than they look: every one of them is a way a
 cell could end up jogging with its guards open when it should not. They are
 written as the fail-closed cases first, because that is the direction in which
 being wrong is dangerous.]]></Comment><BitSize>35741376</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="TcUnit">FB_TestSuite</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>_sfy</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_SafetyStatus</Type><BitSize>46176</BitSize><BitOffs>33574912</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_en</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ManualEnableStatus</Type><BitSize>664</BitSize><BitOffs>33621088</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_axA</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">FB_AxisCM</Type><BitSize>414784</BitSize><BitOffs>33621760</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_refA</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2">AXIS_REF</Type><BitSize>9088</BitSize><BitOffs>34036544</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_sA</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>34045632</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_nA</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>34045648</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_axB</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">FB_AxisCM</Type><BitSize>414784</BitSize><BitOffs>34045696</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_refB</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2">AXIS_REF</Type><BitSize>9088</BitSize><BitOffs>34460480</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_sB</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>34469568</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_nB</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>34469584</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_axC</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">FB_AxisCM</Type><BitSize>414784</BitSize><BitOffs>34469632</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_refC</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2">AXIS_REF</Type><BitSize>9088</BitSize><BitOffs>34884416</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_axD</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">FB_AxisCM</Type><BitSize>414784</BitSize><BitOffs>34893504</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_refD</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2">AXIS_REF</Type><BitSize>9088</BitSize><BitOffs>35308288</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_axE</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules">FB_AxisCM</Type><BitSize>414784</BitSize><BitOffs>35317376</BitOffs></Sub