 bounded pool of documents in the controller's PERSISTENT area, made durable
 by the shipped FB_PersistentDataWriter after every write. For a station with
 no usable file system, or one whose project prefers retentive memory.

 Limits stated, not hidden:
   * MAX_RETAIN_DOCUMENTS documents of up to MAX_PERSIST_DOC_BYTES each, all
     reserved in the persistent budget (8 x 16 kB as shipped); a write that
     finds no free slot fails and is reported.
   * A document's CRC catches a damaged copy, but a persistent image TwinCAT
     itself could not restore comes back as a first boot: this medium cannot
     tell that loss from an empty machine. The file medium can.
   * PERSISTENT data is restored by symbol, so the pool is symbol-readable over
     ADS. It is excluded from OPC UA, but it is NOT confidential: a credential
     store refuses this medium (M_Confidential = FALSE).]]></Comment><BitSize>1064384</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_PersistMediumBase</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>StorageError</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ last error (0 = none)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>7488</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_schema</Name><Type>UINT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>7520</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>TcPersistent</Name></Property><Property><Name>OPC.UA.DA</Name><Value>0</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_docs</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_RetainDocument</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>8</Elements></ArrayInfo><BitSize>1054720</BitSize><BitOffs>7552</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>TcPersistent</Name></Property><Property><Name>OPC.UA.DA</Name><Value>0</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_checked</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1062272</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_rejected</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ an unrecognized pool was cleared: reads report Lost]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1062280</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_writer</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_PersistentDataWriter</Type><BitSize>1920</BitSize><BitOffs>1062336</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>OPC.UA.DA</Name><Value>0</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_phase</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>1064256</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>POOL_SCHEMA</Name><Type>UINT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>1064272</BitOffs><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>NO_SPACE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ADSERR_DEVICE_NOMEMORY]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1064288</BitOffs><Default><Value>1802</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TOO_LARGE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>3