 FILE_JSON/EXTERNAL store instead — the framework never grows this at run time.]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>4</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641633984</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_DATA_CLASSES</Name><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>8</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634000</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_LINE_RECORDS</Name><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>32</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634016</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_WEEKLY_SHIFTS</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ additive V3 capacity; daily layout stays four]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>5</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634032</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_SHIFTS</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ §8.5.2 shifts in a line's calendar]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>4</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634048</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_SHIFT_HISTORY</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ §8.5.2 closed shifts a Unit keeps  // §3.8e values one line carries   // §3.8d project-declared data classes per root]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>8</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634064</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_SET_RECORDS</Name><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>32</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634080</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.MAX_PERSIST_QUEUE</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ requests one medium holds at once (FIFO)]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BaseType>INT</BaseType><Default><Value>8</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>TcVarGlobal</Name></Property></Properties><BitOffs>641634096</BitOffs></Symbol><Symbol><Name>PL_Fraktal.CONFIG_PERSIST_WINDOW_MS</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §3.8b — the DECLARED bounded window an accepted configuration write has
